(- operational_constraint_beta (OC B) (not needed))
(- compliance_certificate_alpha (CC))
(Now steps:)
(1. Release compliance certificate from SA to make CC available.)
(release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(2. Prepare origin availability:)
