(attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(b. Confirm candidate preparedness for OA (requires vehicle_allocated OA, task profile linked, not prepared).)
(confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(c. Assign operator to OA.)
(assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(d. Activate origin node (makes origin_node_ready).)
(activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(e. Load origin payload (makes origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, cargo consumed).)
(load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(f. Unload origin payload (makes origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo available).)
(unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(After unload, we have origin_node_ready true, origin_node_occupied true (still), origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true.)
